SUMMARY:AT -From Sam's Gap South  FITNESS HIKE
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nThe Hike will start at the Sam's G
 ap parking lot. We will hike south on the AT for 5.5 miles to a view point
 . Snack there\, then return. (11.5 miles out and back\, approx. 2650 ft. e
 levation gain) the weather is not looking good at this point so maybe brin
 g a raincoat just in case there is a shower.\nI will post any cancellation
  by 7:15 AM\n\n**Pace:** We will hike at a brisk pace averaging approximat
 ely 2 1/2 -3 mph adjusting for steepness of grade and rugged trail conditi
 ons. Please be comfortable with this distance\, elevation and pace.\n**Dog
 s\; F**riendly dogs ok.\n\n**Car Pool or Follow to the trailhead.** To Car
 pool\, meet at the Park and Ride lot off Exit 17 on I-26 W at 8:30 am. Ple
 ase post if you plan to meet us there otherwise we will see U at the trail
 head at 8:50 am.\n\n**Hike Levels:** Level (1) Up to 600 feet\; Level (2) 
 600'- 900'\; Level (3) 900' - 1200'\; Level (4) 1200' - 1500'\; Level (5) 
 1\,500' - 1\,800'\; Level (6) 1\,800' - 2\,100'\; Level (7) 2\,100' - 2\,4
 00'\; Level (8) 2\,400' - 2700'\; Level (9) 2700' - 3000' Level (10) 3000'
  - 4000'\; Ultimate Hikes are > 4\,000'.\n**Hike Cancellation:** IF YOU SI
 GN ON THIS HIKE AND CHANGE YOU MIND (EVEN IF ON THE WAITLIST) GO BACK TO T
 HE RSVP LINK AND CHANGE YOUR HIKE STATUS TO FREE UP YOUR RESERVED SPOT.\n*
 *Release of Liability:**\nThe organizer of this trip is a volunteer and no
 t a professional guide. The function of the organizer is only to organize 
 this trip. If you sign up or participate in this event you acknowledge tha
 t you freely and voluntarily agree to assume all risks of injuries\, illne
 sses\, and damages arising from\, as a result of\, and associated with thi
 s event. In addition\, you acknowledge that you agree to the Meetup terms:
  [https://www.meetup.com/terms](https://www.meetup.com/terms)
